Package: winratiosim
Type: Package
Title: Simulate Power for Hierarchical Win Ratio Endpoints
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Se", "Yoon"),
           family = "Lee",
           email = "seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Se Yoon Lee [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Se Yoon Lee <seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com>
Description: Provides simulation tools for power analysis in two-arm
    clinical trials with hierarchical win ratio endpoints. The package
    simulates time-to-event, recurrent event, and continuous outcomes,
    applies prioritized pairwise win/loss scoring, and summarizes win
    ratio and Finkelstein-Schoenfeld test operating characteristics.
